    j
```

`nums[i] == nums[j]`, so skip the duplicate.

Next:

```text
 i
 ↓
[1, 1, 2, 2, 3]
       ↑
       j
```

Now `nums[i] != nums[j]`.

Move `i` forward and copy the new unique value:

```text
[1, 2, 2, 2, 3]
    ↑
    i
```

Continue the same process until the end.

Final unique portion:

